<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Powertek 3-mth net up 31.72 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Powertek 3-mth net up 31.72 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  23.04   vs	  17.49</p>
<p>    Annualised EPS (cents)  40.0    vs	  47.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		    57.11   vs	  48.37</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    32.88   vs	  24.99</p>
<p>    Minorities		    -     vs	    -</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	  -     vs	    -</p>
<p>NOTE - Powertek Bhd owns and operated a power generation plant.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
